cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Qimchi using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Qimchi: Live plotting for quantum measurements"
abstract: >-
  Qimchi is an application for plotting measurement data stored as xarray
  datasets, from disk or live while a measurement runs. It reads Zarr, NetCDF
  and HDF5, QCoDeS databases, CSV and other formats, and offers heat maps and
  line plots with filters, line cuts, per-measurement notes and image export.
  It runs as a desktop app on Windows, Linux and macOS, or as a web server.
